  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Trapped inside a purple blood river formation, Wu Yong takes out an Immortal Gu House shaped as a common two-story bamboo building, with bamboo leaves and jade-green dew on them. When he flicks the building, jade dew shoots out and clear wind sweeps purple thoughts and blood-red tides apart. Nearby Gu Immortals read the aura of two rank eight wind path Immortal Gu in the house and treat it as Wu clan’s fourth Immortal Gu House, far stronger than the clan’s first three. Wu Yong says this is the Immortal Gu House his mother constructed, Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building. The novel states he had kept it hidden even from Wu clan Gu Immortals, and that showing it would let Wu clan suppress Southern Border again after Wu Du Xiu’s death.",
      "chapters": [
        1344
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_wu_du_xiu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the purple blood river formation breaks, the house is undamaged and floating, and Seven Illusions Demon Immortal is trapped in a ball of wind before it. Narration then names it a rank eight Immortal Gu House as it tears through the sky toward Yi Tian Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1355
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Southern Border Gu Immortals later acknowledge Wu Yong’s power after he reveals this fourth Immortal Gu House.",
      "chapters": [
        1378
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile equipment of Wu clan, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building’s speed ranks as number one among the Southern Border Immortal Gu Houses of that stretch. When Wu Yong closes on Fang Yuan’s group, the house appears on the horizon as an alarmingly fast rank eight Immortal Gu House, and narration pairs rank eight Gu Immortal Wu Yong with that house.",
      "chapters": [
        1386
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "house-speed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under Feng Jiu Ge’s song, Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building shakes and shows a slight sign of disintegrating, then keeps fighting as Wu Yong drives it into collision and starts activating one of its killer moves. The song continues while the house disintegrates, and Wu Yong later withdraws it from the field.",
      "chapters": [
        1391
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "separation-song-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Lang Ya blessed land, narration recalls that same song as the best method to break immortal formations and Immortal Gu Houses, and that against this rank eight house it had greatly shocked Wu Yong by nearly dismantling it.",
      "chapters": [
        1545
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "separation-song-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    }
  ],
